DD-L003 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L003)

  × command `set_led` talks to the device but has no `timeout_ms`
    ╭─[25-L003-missing-timeout.yaml:34:3]
 33 │     retries: 2
 34 │   set_led:
    ·   ───┬───
    ·      ╰── add timeout_ms
 35 │     args:
    ╰────
  help: every device interaction needs a deadline so a stuck device cannot hang the host (spec
        §9.1)
DD-L016 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L016)

  ⚠ safety block is not signed
    ╭─[25-L003-missing-timeout.yaml:40:1]
 39 │     expect: { header: 0xA0 }
 40 │ safety:
    · ───┬──
    ·    ╰── unsigned
 41 │   limits:
    ╰────
  help: fine for local development; the registry refuses to publish vendor descriptions with an
        unsigned safety block (spec §14.6)
